flowchart TD
    A[Drag audio file] --> B[Decode WAV/MP3/AIFF/FLAC]
    B --> C[Resample + normalize]
    C --> D[STFT multi-resolution]
    D --> E[Pitch + loudness + transient analysis]
    E --> F[Harmonic/noise/resonator extraction]
    F --> G[Optional tiny ONNX timbre encoder]
    G --> H[Timbre states + transitions]
    H --> I[Compressed immutable TimbreModel]
    I --> J[Realtime VoiceManager]
    J --> K[Additive + Noise + Resonator synth]
    K --> L[VST3 stereo output]
